// 0.1.22: daily, weekly and monthly quests from per-player banks (docs/design/quests.md). One Chicago clock: days reset at 00:00 CT (daily goals used to reset at UTC midnight), weeks Monday 00:00 CT, months on the 1st 00:00 CT, 24 h to collect after a reset. Each player draws their own fixed set per period from hash(account, period): 4 of 11 daily quests, 5 of 9 weekly, 4 of 7 monthly, only from sets whose total effort and reward sit in a narrow band; house-key quests only for house owners, no daily night-market quest. Daily (60 coin + white / 100 + blue / 150 + green): 8 right lamps, 3 green+, 3 blue, 3 categories, open the cache, turn a house key, finish a ride game, 3 street matches, 3 districts, 6 in a row, an amber+ lamp; all four = green match. Weekly: Lamp lighter (25 green+, 2,000 + green), Color ladder (1,500 + amber), Hot hand (15 in a row, 1,000 + blue + green), Out and about (3 ride games, 1,200 + blue), Regular (cache on 4 days, 1,000 + green), Homebody (house key on 3 days, 1,000 + green), District walker (10 districts, 1,500 + amber), Gutter gold (12 street matches, 1,500 + green), High lamps (5 amber+, 2,000 + amber); all five = red. Monthly: City tour (4 cities, 15,000 + red), Night shift (12 market lamps, 20,000 + amber), Well read (60 across 4+ categories of 10+, 12,000 + red), Market hopper (market lamps in 3 cities, 16,000 + red), Long run (25 in a row, 12,000 + amber), Red letter (10 red+, 12,000 + red), Steady hand (right lamps on 12 days, 12,000 + amber); all four = Lucky all next month (25,000 coin if Lucky is already yours). The server counts every quest from its own ledger rows (a lamp that spent a match, rides, cache, street, house key; sparks never count), pays each once per period (quest:<period>:<id>) and refuses quests outside your set; guests see a sample set but can't collect. Milestones retired: earned cloths, titles, schematics and patterns stay; a done-but-unclaimed milestone the server can prove pays once; unfinished progress pays 1,000 coin once (legacy:*). Charms retired: Lucky-bit owners keep Lucky for good; Scholar/Sprinter/Lantern refund their stock + schematic (max 3 per account); base reach is 160 m for everyone; no equip slot, HUD charm icon or charm press. Schematics no longer drop; Night glass prints from a pattern plus a press stock or a schematic. The daily first-topic bonus is now "Topic bonus" (was "Category charm"). No DB migration (ledger rows + wallet meta.luckyMonth) (k122a).
